1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,507
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,508 --> 00:00:02,980
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,407 --> 00:00:06,001
(Episode 83)

4
00:00:06,665 --> 00:00:07,665
Se Ri.

5
00:00:08,903 --> 00:00:10,018
What happened?

6
00:00:10,358 --> 00:00:11,712
Let me ask you first.

7
00:00:12,073 --> 00:00:14,713
Why on earth did you have
No Il Dong follow me?

8
00:00:15,192 --> 00:00:17,885
I was worried since he seemed broke, so...

9
00:00:17,886 --> 00:00:20,792
I know. He's broke and a thug.

10
00:00:20,911 --> 00:00:23,190
Why did you meddle in something
I never asked you to?

11
00:00:23,192 --> 00:00:24,812
Look what happened because of it.

12
00:00:24,919 --> 00:00:26,459
And at my workplace, no less.

13
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:28,397
If I lose this job too,

14
00:00:28,399 --> 00:00:31,331
I won't be able to pay my debts
or survive.

15
00:00:31,333 --> 00:00:32,595
Please, calm down first.

16
00:00:33,705 --> 00:00:35,298
Where is that guy now?

17
00:00:35,666 --> 00:00:37,712
- Should we call the police...
- Call the police?

18
00:00:37,925 --> 00:00:39,301
Why would we do that?

19
00:00:39,605 --> 00:00:40,706
Absolutely not.

20
00:00:41,072 --> 00:00:42,905
I told the doctor it was an accident.

21
00:00:42,952 --> 00:00:44,231
I'm a model.

22
00:00:44,825 --> 00:00:47,898
Who'd hire me if they knew I got into
a knife fight with a loan shark?

23
00:00:47,925 --> 00:00:49,531
And what about Ji Ni?

24
00:00:49,878 --> 00:00:52,349
If she finds out I borrowed money
from her in-laws because of this mess,

25
00:00:52,543 --> 00:00:54,292
she won't be able to stay with Ji Hu.

26
00:00:55,105 --> 00:00:58,853
She's already so intimidated by Sun Kyung
that she can't even look her in the eye.

27
00:00:58,920 --> 00:00:59,993
You saw it yourself.

28
00:01:00,241 --> 00:01:01,290
Well...

29
00:01:01,291 --> 00:01:03,375
Please help my daughter and me...

30
00:01:03,661 --> 00:01:06,434
so we don't have to face
any more judgment from others.

31
00:01:07,138 --> 00:01:09,104
Especially now that Ji Ni is married,

32
00:01:09,192 --> 00:01:11,138
I can't let this affect her.

33
00:01:13,445 --> 00:01:17,086
I said I'd take on all the debt
and pay it back myself,

34
00:01:17,174 --> 00:01:20,525
so why did you send someone after him
and cause all this trouble?

35
00:01:22,716 --> 00:01:24,134
Seriously...

36
00:01:33,630 --> 00:01:36,445
General, I'm sorry.

37
00:01:36,991 --> 00:01:39,487
Lieutenant No, don't.
Just rest and recover.

38
00:01:40,345 --> 00:01:44,252
He suddenly pulled out a knife,
and I let my guard down.

39
00:01:44,253 --> 00:01:46,469
Don't talk. We'll discuss it later.

40
00:01:47,497 --> 00:01:48,497
Na Se Ri.

41
00:01:49,112 --> 00:01:50,206
Who on earth was that guy?

42
00:01:50,497 --> 00:01:51,715
What kind of guy was he?

43
00:01:51,717 --> 00:01:53,631
What do you mean? He was a psycho.

44
00:01:56,425 --> 00:01:58,901
Please don't tell my family, General.

45
00:01:58,968 --> 00:01:59,968
Okay.

46
00:02:00,038 --> 00:02:01,699
I'll say you're away
on a business trip for now.

47
00:02:01,725 --> 00:02:04,053
- We won't need to call the police.
- What?

48
00:02:04,700 --> 00:02:07,756
Are we just letting him go?
He's dangerous.

49
00:02:07,758 --> 00:02:09,750
Then why provoke a dangerous man?

50
00:02:12,442 --> 00:02:13,842
Se Ri, let's go.

51
00:02:21,751 --> 00:02:22,751
Se Ri.

52
00:02:23,858 --> 00:02:25,306
I won't report this to the police,

53
00:02:25,340 --> 00:02:27,221
but what if he comes after you again?

54
00:02:27,662 --> 00:02:28,822
You could be in danger.

55
00:02:29,378 --> 00:02:30,927
I'll handle it myself.

56
00:02:31,158 --> 00:02:33,991
If I die, it's on me.
If I live, it's on me.

57
00:02:34,192 --> 00:02:35,828
I understand what you're saying,

58
00:02:36,293 --> 00:02:39,137
but I can't just look the other way
when one of my men is already hurt.

59
00:02:39,498 --> 00:02:41,147
I doubt this is over.

60
00:02:43,265 --> 00:02:45,786
This is about Yeong Ju's family.

61
00:02:46,045 --> 00:02:48,255
Please don't ask any more. I'm sorry.

62
00:02:49,325 --> 00:02:51,560
I'll take my leave, then.

63
00:03:00,965 --> 00:03:03,311
Hey, Lee Cheol!

64
00:03:07,338 --> 00:03:10,159
Where on earth are you, you lunatic?

65
00:03:11,418 --> 00:03:13,596
Let's die together!

66
00:03:21,392 --> 00:03:22,540
No way...

67
00:03:23,443 --> 00:03:24,540
No way...

68
00:03:35,812 --> 00:03:36,937
Ji Ni.

69
00:03:38,825 --> 00:03:39,921
Are you okay?

70
00:03:41,179 --> 00:03:44,446
Yeah. Did you have dinner?

71
00:03:45,530 --> 00:03:46,530
Okay.

72
00:03:46,607 --> 00:03:49,380
No, it's nothing. Okay.

73
00:04:06,798 --> 00:04:07,798
Seung Hyun.

74
00:04:09,162 --> 00:04:10,162
Seung Hyun.

75
00:04:18,765 --> 00:04:20,019
You're having dinner pretty late.

76
00:04:20,640 --> 00:04:21,990
If you haven't eaten, sit down.

77
00:04:21,992 --> 00:04:23,609
No, I'm fine.

78
00:04:25,672 --> 00:04:27,152
Has no one come by?

79
00:04:27,592 --> 00:04:28,720
Who?

80
00:04:29,076 --> 00:04:30,930
Never mind.

81
00:04:31,982 --> 00:04:33,518
Eat up.

82
00:04:34,992 --> 00:04:36,776
Your hair looks nice.

83
00:04:41,272 --> 00:04:43,390
What's with her? She's acting weird.

84
00:04:44,071 --> 00:04:45,071
Who knows?

85
00:04:45,638 --> 00:04:46,872
Who can figure her out?

86
00:04:46,998 --> 00:04:48,960
Why are you so prickly? Did you two fight?

87
00:04:49,107 --> 00:04:50,874
We didn't. Just eat.

88
00:04:57,338 --> 00:04:59,001
This is driving me crazy.

89
00:05:04,152 --> 00:05:05,329
At least this...

90
00:05:37,398 --> 00:05:38,648
Should I just die?

91
00:05:47,638 --> 00:05:49,031
What do I do?

92
00:05:51,798 --> 00:05:54,068
Honey, what am I supposed to do?

93
00:05:54,785 --> 00:05:57,371
What about our dear Ji Ni?

94
00:06:16,731 --> 00:06:18,057
Get some sleep.

95
00:06:19,817 --> 00:06:20,817
No.

96
00:06:21,012 --> 00:06:23,391
You haven't finished your work.
How can I sleep first?

97
00:06:24,265 --> 00:06:25,818
Your eyes are already drooping.

98
00:06:25,820 --> 00:06:28,838
But Tae O said something strange today.

99
00:06:30,198 --> 00:06:32,543
He finds it strange
that Jung A and my mom are so close.

100
00:06:33,148 --> 00:06:35,726
Jung A gets along with everyone.
Does that bother you too?

101
00:06:35,892 --> 00:06:37,336
Am I the only one who hasn't noticed?

102
00:06:43,778 --> 00:06:46,228
That thing keeps me up at night.
I'm even more exhausted.

103
00:06:46,652 --> 00:06:49,590
- Should I just rip it off?
- No. You'll be in trouble.

104
00:06:50,072 --> 00:06:51,259
Get some sleep.

105
00:06:59,465 --> 00:07:02,629
Mother, did you need something?

106
00:07:03,625 --> 00:07:06,096
My shoulders are so stiff
that I can barely turn my neck.

107
00:07:06,098 --> 00:07:08,748
- Aren't you strong?
- Yes, I am. Very strong.

108
00:07:08,812 --> 00:07:09,812
Let me massage you.

109
00:07:13,831 --> 00:07:14,932
How's that?

110
00:07:15,552 --> 00:07:17,598
Yes, you've got strong hands.

111
00:07:17,798 --> 00:07:20,336
My son even massages your mom's feet.

112
00:07:21,105 --> 00:07:22,757
I won't make you do that.

113
00:07:24,044 --> 00:07:26,532
I'm sorry. I'll talk to my mom.

114
00:07:26,652 --> 00:07:30,646
So your mom only gets the message
when someone spells it out for her?

115
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:34,324
- I'm sorry.
- Forget it.

116
00:07:35,318 --> 00:07:37,443
Some people were never meant to meet.

117
00:07:37,445 --> 00:07:39,405
- Press harder there.
- Okay.

118
00:07:41,885 --> 00:07:43,499
By the way, Mother,

119
00:07:45,152 --> 00:07:46,331
the buzzer...

120
00:07:46,425 --> 00:07:49,824
Could you please not buzz us at night?

121
00:07:49,859 --> 00:07:50,859
What?

122
00:07:53,672 --> 00:07:56,171
Ji Hu has a hard time getting up for work.

123
00:07:56,491 --> 00:07:59,051
He keeps waking up at night
and says he's exhausted.

124
00:07:59,105 --> 00:08:00,714
Ji Hu said that?

125
00:08:01,405 --> 00:08:02,743
You made that up, didn't you?

126
00:08:03,191 --> 00:08:05,678
I thought you were naive,
but you're pretty sly.

127
00:08:06,878 --> 00:08:10,518
I complimented your massage skills,
but you had an ulterior motive, right?

128
00:08:10,739 --> 00:08:13,412
- No, that's not what I meant...
- Enough.

129
00:08:13,665 --> 00:08:16,037
Are you acting like this because
I said something about your mom?

130
00:08:16,745 --> 00:08:18,854
Don't try to pull anything.
I see right through you.

131
00:08:18,928 --> 00:08:19,928
That's enough. Go.

132
00:08:20,378 --> 00:08:21,792
I don't need a massage or anything.

133
00:08:52,119 --> 00:08:54,119
Lie down already.

134
00:09:44,072 --> 00:09:46,408
- You're home, Joong Bin?
- Yeah.

135
00:09:46,772 --> 00:09:48,522
Why are you still in the kitchen?

136
00:09:49,358 --> 00:09:51,765
Dinner must've been salty.
I've been thirsty all night.

137
00:09:52,672 --> 00:09:54,667
- Have you eaten?
- Of course.

138
00:09:56,225 --> 00:09:58,220
I sent Lieutenant No
on a short business trip.

139
00:09:58,221 --> 00:09:59,467
He'll be busy for a while.

140
00:09:59,477 --> 00:10:03,248
No wonder he wasn't answering my calls.
I thought something was wrong.

141
00:10:03,663 --> 00:10:05,523
- Got it. Have a good rest.
- Okay.

142
00:10:09,565 --> 00:10:12,012
What kind of business trip
keeps him from answering his phone?

143
00:10:56,992 --> 00:10:58,522
What? Is it broken?

144
00:11:08,552 --> 00:11:10,172
You two, seriously...

145
00:11:24,225 --> 00:11:25,225
You little...

146
00:11:26,995 --> 00:11:27,995
Mother.

147
00:11:31,391 --> 00:11:33,173
You little brat!

148
00:11:34,019 --> 00:11:35,019
Ji Ni.

149
00:11:36,886 --> 00:11:39,369
- Mom.
- How dare you put tape on it?

150
00:11:40,045 --> 00:11:41,418
You rude little brat.

151
00:11:42,245 --> 00:11:45,207
Didn't I tell you this was my mouth
for calling you? Didn't I?

152
00:11:45,605 --> 00:11:48,907
And you taped up
your mother-in-law's mouth like this?

153
00:11:50,652 --> 00:11:52,798
Do you hate it that much when I call you?

154
00:11:52,865 --> 00:11:55,605
- Mother, it's not like that.
- What do you mean, it's not?

155
00:11:56,172 --> 00:11:57,769
And you say you want us to be close?

156
00:11:58,155 --> 00:11:59,570
You're all talk.

157
00:11:59,571 --> 00:12:01,341
- Mom.
- Stay out of this.

158
00:12:01,872 --> 00:12:04,608
Taking your wife's side now
is the most pathetic thing you can do.

159
00:12:05,031 --> 00:12:06,031
You. Explain yourself.

160
00:12:06,182 --> 00:12:08,533
Speak up. Is your mouth taped shut too?

161
00:12:08,865 --> 00:12:11,325
What on earth were you thinking
when you did this?

162
00:12:12,172 --> 00:12:14,052
You call me "Mother" to my face,

163
00:12:14,405 --> 00:12:17,390
but behind my back, it's another story.
You're no different from your mom.

164
00:12:17,392 --> 00:12:18,698
Please stop!

165
00:12:20,025 --> 00:12:22,753
Are you shouting at me?
In front of this girl?

166
00:12:22,754 --> 00:12:24,413
Don't call her that! She's my wife!

167
00:12:24,414 --> 00:12:25,908
Some wife she is!

168
00:12:28,705 --> 00:12:29,705
Sun Kyung.

169
00:12:29,785 --> 00:12:32,161
Why are you doing this at this hour?

170
00:12:32,243 --> 00:12:33,371
Let go.

171
00:12:35,832 --> 00:12:36,982
What's going on here?

172
00:12:46,511 --> 00:12:47,823
I did it.

173
00:12:48,372 --> 00:12:50,652
I couldn't sleep at night,
so I tried to quiet the buzzer.

174
00:12:51,105 --> 00:12:52,558
Why get so angry over that?

175
00:12:53,338 --> 00:12:56,197
Dad, what's strange to me
is using the buzzer at this hour.

176
00:12:56,259 --> 00:12:57,604
Didn't I tell you to stay out of this?

177
00:12:57,605 --> 00:12:58,949
You're the one who needs to stop, Mom.

178
00:12:59,712 --> 00:13:01,967
Ji Ni's mom treats me
with nothing but kindness and love.

179
00:13:01,968 --> 00:13:03,189
Why can't you do the same?

180
00:13:03,452 --> 00:13:05,654
Please, can't you be like other moms
just this once?

181
00:13:05,656 --> 00:13:06,748
You little brat!

182
00:13:08,738 --> 00:13:10,399
You ring the buzzer at this hour,

183
00:13:10,581 --> 00:13:12,024
then come and shove your son's wife.

184
00:13:12,697 --> 00:13:14,011
I never imagined you doing that.

185
00:13:14,245 --> 00:13:15,659
I've never even seen it happen.

186
00:13:16,872 --> 00:13:18,242
Why are you doing this to me?

187
00:13:18,792 --> 00:13:20,642
- Since I was a child, you've...
- Lim Ji Hu!

188
00:13:23,572 --> 00:13:24,572
You...

189
00:13:25,132 --> 00:13:28,066
When did you set this thing up?

190
00:13:29,952 --> 00:13:31,685
It was there after our honeymoon.

191
00:13:32,532 --> 00:13:35,438
It rings day and night.
I'm about to lose my mind.

192
00:13:35,852 --> 00:13:37,577
I'm so embarrassed in front of Ji Ni.

193
00:13:37,918 --> 00:13:39,196
Ever since Ji Hu came into my life,

194
00:13:40,868 --> 00:13:42,187
I've spent half my life...

195
00:13:43,302 --> 00:13:44,825
suffering from insomnia.

196
00:13:46,418 --> 00:13:49,730
I'm suffering and can't sleep at night,

197
00:13:50,208 --> 00:13:51,969
and I'm her mother-in-law, after all.

198
00:13:52,778 --> 00:13:54,446
If she really cared about me,

199
00:13:54,569 --> 00:13:57,132
shouldn't she be checking on me
without waiting to be told?

200
00:13:57,955 --> 00:14:00,231
Instead of just saying
she wants us to be close.

201
00:14:00,482 --> 00:14:02,778
I'm sorry. That was thoughtless of me.

202
00:14:02,972 --> 00:14:05,157
That girl isn't warm or friendly.

203
00:14:05,412 --> 00:14:07,433
She can't even tell when I need care.

204
00:14:13,611 --> 00:14:14,611
Let's talk.

205
00:14:14,959 --> 00:14:15,959
Please, Father.

206
00:14:16,378 --> 00:14:18,972
I'll go apologize to Mother.
I'll beg her to forgive me.

207
00:14:20,038 --> 00:14:22,836
Ji Ni, stop apologizing.

208
00:14:23,532 --> 00:14:25,522
We didn't marry to beg for forgiveness.

209
00:14:27,464 --> 00:14:28,464
Let's talk, Dad.

210
00:14:36,732 --> 00:14:38,022
What do I do?

211
00:14:38,544 --> 00:14:39,611
It's my fault again...

212
00:14:39,705 --> 00:14:41,022
This isn't your fault.

213
00:14:41,232 --> 00:14:43,352
Just wait. Ji Hu will handle it.

214
00:14:43,885 --> 00:14:44,885
That's right.

215
00:14:45,165 --> 00:14:46,872
My brother knows what to do.

216
00:14:46,897 --> 00:14:48,337
Don't worry.

217
00:14:51,965 --> 00:14:53,390
Shouldn't you go check on them?

218
00:14:54,071 --> 00:14:56,260
I'm thinking about that.

219
00:14:56,912 --> 00:15:00,673
For now, I think it's better to give them
some time to talk as father and son.

220
00:15:09,945 --> 00:15:10,979
Ji Hu.

221
00:15:12,216 --> 00:15:13,460
Don't try to calm me down.

222
00:15:13,872 --> 00:15:15,047
I'm so angry.

223
00:15:15,105 --> 00:15:17,698
Since marriage came up, Mom keeps
calling her a mistress's daughter.

224
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:20,747
Ji Ni spent her life
too ashamed to hold her head up.

225
00:15:20,792 --> 00:15:22,158
And now we're married.

226
00:15:22,425 --> 00:15:24,772
Yet Mom keeps saying
Ji Ni is just like her mom.

227
00:15:25,285 --> 00:15:26,740
Does she have to hear that even at dawn?

228
00:15:26,859 --> 00:15:28,293
What did Ji Ni ever do wrong?

229
00:15:30,438 --> 00:15:32,618
Your mom had high hopes for you.

230
00:15:33,329 --> 00:15:35,703
Those weren't hopes.
That was just her selfish ambition.

231
00:15:35,771 --> 00:15:36,771
Ji Hu...

232
00:15:37,212 --> 00:15:39,402
She never once showed me any warmth...

233
00:15:39,706 --> 00:15:41,684
until she found out I was good at piano.

234
00:15:42,512 --> 00:15:43,512
You know that.

235
00:15:45,552 --> 00:15:49,089
Ji Ni shouldn't be humiliated
for something that isn't her fault.

236
00:15:49,995 --> 00:15:51,166
It makes me so angry.

237
00:15:51,411 --> 00:15:52,928
Do you want to move out?

238
00:15:56,352 --> 00:15:57,673
Dad, you and Mom raised me.

239
00:15:58,408 --> 00:16:00,395
I want to spend my life
repaying you for that.

240
00:16:00,578 --> 00:16:03,138
But I feel my only family
is being disrespected.

241
00:16:05,219 --> 00:16:08,073
Why didn't you mention the buzzer
when you got back from your honeymoon?

242
00:16:08,097 --> 00:16:09,581
Ji Ni asked me not to.

243
00:16:09,723 --> 00:16:11,485
She said they needed a way to communicate.

244
00:16:12,059 --> 00:16:15,239
If Mom hadn't used it late at night
or at dawn, it wouldn't have come to this.

245
00:16:16,457 --> 00:16:18,123
Even during the day,
she gets startled while drawing,

246
00:16:18,331 --> 00:16:19,531
but she said she could bear it.

247
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,052
I see.

248
00:16:22,177 --> 00:16:24,693
I'm sorry for what your mom did.
I'll apologize to Ji Ni too.

249
00:16:27,825 --> 00:16:28,825
I'm sorry.

250
00:16:29,855 --> 00:16:31,630
But I'm so upset, Dad.

251
00:16:32,227 --> 00:16:33,392
So am I.

252
00:16:33,978 --> 00:16:36,336
Try to see things from your mom's side
and forgive her.

253
00:17:04,691 --> 00:17:06,573
Don't start lecturing me.

254
00:17:06,762 --> 00:17:08,002
I did nothing wrong.

255
00:17:08,825 --> 00:17:11,458
Don't worry. I protect my own.

256
00:17:12,605 --> 00:17:14,473
There you go with that line again.

257
00:17:14,843 --> 00:17:16,146
Is this the military?

258
00:17:16,170 --> 00:17:17,299
What's the difference?

259
00:17:18,312 --> 00:17:20,652
Ever since we married,
I've been determined to protect you.

260
00:17:21,351 --> 00:17:22,351
And one more thing.

261
00:17:22,931 --> 00:17:24,947
Ji Hu and Ji Ni are my family now too.
I'll protect them as well.

262
00:17:24,972 --> 00:17:26,208
Watch how you treat them.

263
00:17:30,025 --> 00:17:31,025
Honey!

264
00:17:32,224 --> 00:17:33,477
Go make breakfast.

265
00:17:33,625 --> 00:17:36,314
Don't just say you love your son.
Make him breakfast.

266
00:17:37,131 --> 00:17:40,395
Don't just talk about your own pain.
See how other people are feeling too.

267
00:17:42,425 --> 00:17:43,939
That man, honestly...

268
00:17:44,945 --> 00:17:45,978
Sun Kyung.

269
00:17:47,177 --> 00:17:48,995
Show Ji Ni some affection.

270
00:17:49,505 --> 00:17:50,875
That's how Ji Hu can be happy.

271
00:17:50,925 --> 00:17:53,495
If he's happy, you'll be happy.
Then I can be happy too.

272
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:54,520
Don't you agree?

273
00:17:57,965 --> 00:18:00,666
Come on. Let's go out smiling.

274
00:18:01,606 --> 00:18:04,600
I just have to put up with it. Honestly.

275
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:06,837
That's right.

276
00:18:19,725 --> 00:18:20,725
Hello, ma'am.

277
00:18:21,049 --> 00:18:22,049
Jung A.

278
00:18:22,313 --> 00:18:25,504
I'm feeling down.
Would you like to have lunch together?

279
00:18:26,740 --> 00:18:29,162
I'm sorry, but...

280
00:18:29,678 --> 00:18:32,269
I'm at the academy, not the studio.

281
00:18:33,364 --> 00:18:35,642
I think I'll have to eat lunch here.

282
00:18:36,759 --> 00:18:39,549
Yes, ma'am. I'm sorry.

283
00:18:40,755 --> 00:18:42,198
I'll call you later.

284
00:18:47,651 --> 00:18:49,557
Why should I have to do this?

285
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,407
Good, I'm not too late.

286
00:18:54,081 --> 00:18:56,115
I need to get to my class. What is it?

287
00:18:56,140 --> 00:18:57,525
Let's have lunch before you go.

288
00:18:58,080 --> 00:18:59,637
Here. Gimbap.

289
00:19:00,165 --> 00:19:03,547
Why is everyone asking me
to have lunch with them today?

290
00:19:03,692 --> 00:19:05,491
Do I make food look that good?

291
00:19:08,112 --> 00:19:09,408
By the way...

292
00:19:09,937 --> 00:19:11,655
Why are you so close to Ji Hu's mom?

293
00:19:12,864 --> 00:19:14,065
Not this again.

294
00:19:14,774 --> 00:19:15,959
Is this coming from Ji Ni?

295
00:19:16,447 --> 00:19:18,855
Ji Ni? No. Why?

296
00:19:18,972 --> 00:19:20,297
Did she say something too?

297
00:19:20,978 --> 00:19:23,383
If even Ji Ni spoke up,

298
00:19:23,488 --> 00:19:25,293
you must've really overstepped.

299
00:19:25,317 --> 00:19:26,835
I didn't overstep.

300
00:19:26,860 --> 00:19:28,249
She's just nice to me!

301
00:19:30,245 --> 00:19:31,907
I'm close to Ji Ni's mom too.

302
00:19:31,978 --> 00:19:34,644
So why is it suddenly weird
when it's Ji Hu's mom?

303
00:19:35,119 --> 00:19:37,706
I'm not eating. I've lost my appetite.

304
00:19:38,578 --> 00:19:42,441
She actually just invited me to lunch,
but I turned her down!

305
00:19:42,612 --> 00:19:44,431
You made the right call.

306
00:19:45,532 --> 00:19:46,532
But...

307
00:19:46,849 --> 00:19:49,134
you don't still like Ji Hu, do you?

308
00:19:51,014 --> 00:19:52,014
What did you say?

309
00:19:52,020 --> 00:19:54,077
Hey, I'm really good at reading people.

310
00:19:55,965 --> 00:19:58,349
What about you?
Don't you still like Ji Ni?

311
00:19:58,525 --> 00:20:01,505
When you care, you pay attention.
When you pay attention, you notice things.

312
00:20:01,992 --> 00:20:03,553
Maybe you're right.

313
00:20:03,852 --> 00:20:07,233
Love isn't a business
you can open and close at will.

314
00:20:07,512 --> 00:20:10,644
You can't control your feelings,
but you can control your actions.

315
00:20:10,668 --> 00:20:11,690
You have to keep them in check.

316
00:20:12,811 --> 00:20:14,410
I'm only saying this for your sake.

317
00:20:14,872 --> 00:20:16,695
Don't make a stupid mistake
and give people a reason to criticize you.

318
00:20:17,244 --> 00:20:19,004
I don't want people criticizing you.

319
00:20:19,028 --> 00:20:20,423
After all the grief you've given me.

320
00:20:20,878 --> 00:20:22,366
Don't try to comfort me.

321
00:20:22,491 --> 00:20:24,340
Okay. Eat up.

322
00:20:31,405 --> 00:20:32,405
Father,

323
00:20:32,675 --> 00:20:34,970
- about what happened this morning...
- I owe you an apology.

324
00:20:35,977 --> 00:20:36,977
What?

325
00:20:38,005 --> 00:20:39,534
Ji Hu's mom went too far.

326
00:20:40,005 --> 00:20:42,433
She shouldn't have barged into your room
while you were asleep.

327
00:20:43,372 --> 00:20:46,125
But I understand why she installed
the buzzer too.

328
00:20:46,994 --> 00:20:49,226
She has a lot of health issues
and is very sensitive.

329
00:20:49,415 --> 00:20:50,959
She needs help all the time.

330
00:20:51,914 --> 00:20:55,204
She can't keep coming upstairs
to call you whenever she needs something.

331
00:20:56,099 --> 00:20:57,200
I understand.

332
00:20:57,658 --> 00:21:00,446
I only put tape over it
to make it quieter.

333
00:21:00,471 --> 00:21:02,199
I didn't realize it'd become that quiet.

334
00:21:02,223 --> 00:21:03,344
It was my fault.

335
00:21:04,146 --> 00:21:05,738
Things have been tough since the wedding,
haven't they?

336
00:21:06,116 --> 00:21:07,192
Not at all.

337
00:21:07,725 --> 00:21:11,145
I'm grateful you welcomed me
despite all my shortcomings.

338
00:21:11,898 --> 00:21:13,392
You're just like Ji Hu.

339
00:21:14,191 --> 00:21:15,965
You're both so overly grateful.

340
00:21:15,983 --> 00:21:18,817
As a parent, it makes me feel
like you're keeping your distance.

341
00:21:19,005 --> 00:21:21,138
That's not it, Father.

342
00:21:21,812 --> 00:21:25,266
From now on, I'll spend more time
downstairs on the first floor.

343
00:21:25,291 --> 00:21:27,050
So Mother won't have to call me.

344
00:21:27,205 --> 00:21:28,785
I can work at the dining table.

345
00:21:29,368 --> 00:21:30,368
Thank you.

346
00:21:31,818 --> 00:21:33,197
You know, don't you?

347
00:21:37,046 --> 00:21:39,061
That we're not Ji Hu's birth parents.

348
00:21:40,173 --> 00:21:41,173
Yes.

349
00:21:41,198 --> 00:21:44,875
I'm most worried
about how deeply this could hurt him.

350
00:21:45,378 --> 00:21:47,476
Once that kind of rift opens,
it's hard to mend.

351
00:21:48,072 --> 00:21:49,419
I hope you'll help us.

352
00:21:49,996 --> 00:21:52,030
Of course. I'll do my best.

353
00:21:57,198 --> 00:21:58,198
By the way,

354
00:21:59,134 --> 00:22:01,620
does your mom do anything
besides modeling?

355
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:03,110
No.

356
00:22:03,432 --> 00:22:06,226
She used to play the cello,
but now she only models.

357
00:22:06,955 --> 00:22:09,067
I wondered if she'd ever done anything...

358
00:22:09,069 --> 00:22:11,332
with Yeong Ju's family.

359
00:22:11,474 --> 00:22:13,675
No, nothing like that.

360
00:22:14,147 --> 00:22:15,819
- Why do you ask?
- Well...

361
00:22:15,844 --> 00:22:17,059
Just curious.

362
00:22:18,356 --> 00:22:19,451
Get back to work.

363
00:22:20,337 --> 00:22:21,337
Okay.

364
00:22:38,448 --> 00:22:41,126
I'm not sure this is the person
you're looking for.

365
00:22:41,412 --> 00:22:43,212
Anyway, I'm sending you the results.

366
00:22:49,304 --> 00:22:50,523
What are you looking at?

367
00:22:51,125 --> 00:22:52,989
Did the photo come in?

368
00:22:53,546 --> 00:22:54,546
Yes.

369
00:22:56,811 --> 00:23:00,042
We can't tell anything
just by looking at this.

370
00:23:00,067 --> 00:23:01,419
How are we supposed to find this person?

371
00:23:01,444 --> 00:23:02,544
Exactly.

372
00:23:02,824 --> 00:23:06,096
The statute of limitations has expired,
but I might take it to the police anyway.

373
00:23:06,172 --> 00:23:07,172
Okay.

374
00:23:07,452 --> 00:23:09,221
This is probably beyond
what you can handle.

375
00:23:10,190 --> 00:23:13,644
I thought the photo would clear things up,
but I guess I expected too much.

376
00:23:23,091 --> 00:23:25,992
The person you're calling is unavailable.
Please leave a message...

377
00:23:34,976 --> 00:23:38,916
He stabbed someone.
Where on earth is he, and what's he doing?

378
00:23:49,939 --> 00:23:52,478
Hey, everything okay?

379
00:23:52,503 --> 00:23:54,100
Would you be happy
if something were wrong?

380
00:23:54,511 --> 00:23:56,872
I said I'm fine.
Why do you keep asking, Mom?

381
00:23:57,292 --> 00:24:00,967
I had a bad dream last night.
That's why I'm asking.

382
00:24:00,987 --> 00:24:02,728
Why are you snapping at me?

383
00:24:03,011 --> 00:24:04,092
Okay.

384
00:24:04,214 --> 00:24:05,214
Yeah.

385
00:24:19,231 --> 00:24:21,140
I figured no one else would,
so I got some.

386
00:24:22,231 --> 00:24:24,943
None of this would've been possible
without the General.

387
00:24:25,866 --> 00:24:27,653
I know. I'll get going.

388
00:24:28,562 --> 00:24:30,882
He said you split the money for that leg.

389
00:24:31,275 --> 00:24:32,304
What does that mean?

390
00:24:33,711 --> 00:24:35,178
He actually said that?

391
00:24:35,202 --> 00:24:36,202
Yeah.

392
00:24:37,784 --> 00:24:40,541
What was he talking about? I have no idea.

393
00:24:41,545 --> 00:24:43,492
Why bother listening to that lunatic?

394
00:24:43,878 --> 00:24:44,878
Eat.

395
00:24:45,052 --> 00:24:46,388
I've got a shoot. I'm leaving.

396
00:25:07,242 --> 00:25:08,442
What are you doing?

397
00:25:09,184 --> 00:25:10,586
Can't you see the soup is boiling over?

398
00:25:10,611 --> 00:25:11,611
Sorry.

399
00:25:13,858 --> 00:25:16,470
Have you seen this man before?

400
00:25:18,518 --> 00:25:19,869
No.

401
00:25:23,279 --> 00:25:24,929
I think I saw him at Ji Ni's wedding.

402
00:25:25,104 --> 00:25:26,320
Ji Ni's wedding?

403
00:25:26,814 --> 00:25:28,176
Whose guest was he?

404
00:25:28,498 --> 00:25:31,038
I don't know.
I don't think he was Ji Ni's friend.

405
00:25:31,159 --> 00:25:32,159
Ji Hu's?

406
00:25:32,184 --> 00:25:33,521
Or that woman?

407
00:25:34,058 --> 00:25:35,058
That woman?

408
00:25:38,917 --> 00:25:40,821
That student is here again.

409
00:25:41,159 --> 00:25:44,312
The student I used to teach.

410
00:25:45,639 --> 00:25:47,157
She said she used to teach him.

411
00:25:47,415 --> 00:25:48,519
Really?

412
00:25:48,544 --> 00:25:50,207
He doesn't look like the cello type.

413
00:25:50,232 --> 00:25:51,232
Where's that woman?

414
00:25:51,558 --> 00:25:53,256
- At the office?
- I don't know.

415
00:25:53,281 --> 00:25:55,208
If she's not at a shoot,
she's probably there.

416
00:25:56,832 --> 00:25:58,145
Seung Hyun!

417
00:26:24,678 --> 00:26:25,678
You...

418
00:26:26,328 --> 00:26:27,704
How did you get in here...

419
00:26:29,485 --> 00:26:31,421
- What do you want now?
- What do I want?

420
00:26:33,025 --> 00:26:35,457
You had someone following me,
and now you're asking what I want?

421
00:26:35,759 --> 00:26:36,759
What?

422
00:26:38,958 --> 00:26:40,327
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

423
00:26:40,351 --> 00:26:42,033
Do you think I'm a joke?

424
00:26:42,370 --> 00:26:44,011
Don't you dare disrespect me!

425
00:26:45,292 --> 00:26:48,172
I had nothing to do with it.

426
00:26:48,362 --> 00:26:49,695
You're lying.

427
00:26:55,285 --> 00:26:57,726
That doesn't give you the right
to pull a knife on someone!

428
00:26:58,367 --> 00:27:00,234
Why would you bring up
the money for the leg?

429
00:27:00,618 --> 00:27:02,015
Didn't I warn you?

430
00:27:02,077 --> 00:27:05,015
I told you if you said one wrong word,
you wouldn't get a cent.

431
00:27:09,612 --> 00:27:12,368
Here! Take the money!

432
00:27:13,025 --> 00:27:14,903
If you sell everything in that bag too,

433
00:27:15,129 --> 00:27:16,516
you'll get a decent amount.

434
00:27:16,798 --> 00:27:18,935
I really don't know anymore.

435
00:27:18,960 --> 00:27:20,344
I swear, I know nothing!

436
00:27:20,432 --> 00:27:22,477
Take it and get out, you scumbag!

437
00:27:23,224 --> 00:27:25,943
If we both ruined his leg,
we're accomplices.

438
00:27:26,232 --> 00:27:28,570
So why am I the only one
being treated like a criminal?

439
00:27:29,952 --> 00:27:31,949
You were the one who tripped him first!

440
00:27:32,365 --> 00:27:35,035
He was already down,
so I tripped over him too!

441
00:27:35,565 --> 00:27:37,565
Stop talking!

442
00:27:45,899 --> 00:27:46,899
What...

443
00:27:48,142 --> 00:27:49,349
are you talking about?

444
00:27:59,498 --> 00:28:00,680
Was it you two?

445
00:28:02,436 --> 00:28:04,033
You're the ones who did this to Seung Woo?

446
00:28:04,971 --> 00:28:06,817
Seung Hyun...

447
00:28:08,785 --> 00:28:10,322
You kept this a secret...

448
00:28:11,498 --> 00:28:12,957
while living with us?

449
00:28:15,644 --> 00:28:16,970
Is that true?

450
00:28:47,087 --> 00:28:50,346
(Family Register)

451
00:28:50,370 --> 00:28:51,446
Don't even try to make excuses.

452
00:28:51,471 --> 00:28:54,276
- Don't even dream of being forgiven.
- You paid him?

453
00:28:54,301 --> 00:28:55,932
You actually gave that jerk money?

454
00:28:55,947 --> 00:28:57,949
Let's never see each other again.
We're done. For good.

455
00:28:57,984 --> 00:28:59,962
If you keep building my life
on other people's suffering,

456
00:28:59,963 --> 00:29:01,323
how can I hold my head up?

457
00:29:01,348 --> 00:29:02,712
I have to find my own way.

458
00:29:02,737 --> 00:29:03,949
I can't let myself fall apart like this.

459
00:29:03,974 --> 00:29:05,102
I feel like I'm going to die.

460
00:29:05,127 --> 00:29:06,467
No. I feel like I'm going to kill someone.

461
00:29:06,514 --> 00:29:09,023
I want to break Ji Ni's leg myself.

462
00:29:10,606 --> 00:29:12,606
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
